hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1910","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) in kalimaat ke saath dua kiya kartay thay: Ae Allah! Main Teri panah maangta hun jahannam ke fitnay aur jahannam ke azaab se, qabr ke fitnay aur qabr ke azaab se, ameeri ke fitnay ki burai aur faqeeri ke fitnay ki burai se. Aur main Masih Dajjal ke fitnay ke shar se Teri panah maangta hun. Ae Allah! Mere gunaahon ko baraf aur aulay ke pani se dho de aur mera dil gunaahon se aisay paak kar de jaisay Tu ne safed kapray ko mail kuchail se paak kar diya aur mujh ko gunaahon se aisay door kar de jaisay Tu ne mashriq ko maghrib se door kiya hai. Ae Allah! Main susti, burhapay, gunah aur qarz se Teri panah maangta hun. (Muslim: 8/75). Baab: Aajizi aur susti se panah ke baaray mein. (Muslim mein hun hai aur aakhir mein fainni hai.)"
"1911","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmaya kartay thay: Ae Allah! Main aajiz honay, susti, buzdili, burhapay aur bakheeli se Teri panah maangta hun aur qabr ke azaab aur zindagi aur maut ke fitnay se Teri panah maangta hun. (Muslim: 8/75). Baab: Buri qaza aur badbakhti mein parnay se panah ke baaray mein."
"1912","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) buri qaza, buri taqdeer, aur badbakhti mein parnay se, dushmanon ke khush honay aur aazmaish ki sakhti se panah maanga kartay thay. Amr ne ye bhi kaha ke Sufyan, hadees ke rawi, ne kaha ke mujhe shak hai ke in chaar cheezon mein se aik cheez main ne is hadees mein zyada kar di. (Muslim: 8/76). Baab: Nemat ke zawal se panah. (Sufyan se murad Ibn Uyaina hain; Bukhari mein hai ke Sufyan ne kaha: Teen, main ne aik zyada ki, maloom nahi wo kaun si hai; Ismaily ne wazahat ki ke zyada jumla dushmanon ki khushi hai.)"
"1913","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah ki dua mein ye bhi thi ke: Ae Allah! Main Teri nemat ke zawal se aur aafiyat aur di hui sehat ke palat janay se aur Tere achanak azaab se aur Tere ghazab walay sab kaamon se Teri panah maangta hun. (Muslim: 8/88-89)"
"1914","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay do aadmiyon ko chheenk aayi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik ko jawab diya aur doosray ko jawab na diya. Jis ko jawab na diya tha, us ne kaha ke us ko chheenk aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jawab diya, lekin mujhe chheenk aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jawab na diya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ne, yani jis ka jawab diya, Alhamdulillah kaha tha aur tu ne Alhamdulillah na kaha, is liye jawab na diya. (Muslim: 8/225)"
"1915","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Salama se riwayat hai ke un ke walid, Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu), ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik aadmi ko chheenk aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke YarhamukAllah. Phir usay dobara chheenk aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ko zukaam ho gaya hai, yani agar kisi ko zukaam se chheenkein aa rahi hon to us ko kahan tak YarhamukAllah kahein ge. (Muslim: 8/225)"
